23: <div class="overlay" id="intro"><div class="intro"><div class="kicker">A cozy isekai adventure · all companions are adults</div><h2>Somewhere<br>between worlds.</h2><p>You wake beneath a sky full of unfamiliar stars. The valley’s beacon has gone quiet, and little pockets of night are spreading. Find its lost light, help the people you meet, and decide what home means.</p><button class="start" id="start">STEP INTO THE VALE &nbsp; →</button><p class="note">A gentle fantasy adventure with friendship and optional, non-explicit romance.</p></div></div>
24: <div class="endcard" id="ending"><article><div class="kicker">The valley remembers</div><h2>Light finds its way home.</h2><p>You return the five stars to the beacon. The vale glows again, and your friends gather beneath the night sky—close, content, and ready for whatever comes next.</p><p id="endingBonds"></p><button class="start" id="continue">KEEP EXPLORING</button></article></div>
